.nh
.TH toolbox-list 1
.SH "نام (NAME)"
toolbox-list \- List existing Toolbx containers and images

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBtoolbox list\fP [\fI--containers\fP | \fI-c\fP] [\fI--images\fP | \fI-i\fP]

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Lists existing Toolbx containers and images. These are OCI containers and
images, which can be managed directly with a tool like \fBpodman\fR\&.

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
The following options are understood:

.PP
\fB--containers, -c\fP

.PP
List only Toolbx containers, not images.

.PP
\fB--images, -i\fP

.PP
List only Toolbx images, not containers.

.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.SS List all existing Toolbx containers and images
.EX
$ toolbox list
.EE

.SS List existing Toolbx containers only
.EX
$ toolbox list --containers
.EE

.SS List existing Toolbx images only
.EX
$ toolbox list --images
.EE

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBtoolbox(1)\fR, \fBpodman(1)\fR, \fBpodman-ps(1)\fR, \fBpodman-images(1)\fR
